    <string name="onb_privacy_title">Privacy and FITNEX AI</string>
    <string name="onb_privacy_body">You decide what artificial intelligence does with your data.</string>
    <string name="onb_ai_consent">Allow FITNEX AI to use my data</string>
    <string name="onb_ai_consent_desc">When you talk to FITNEX AI or analyze a meal, the information needed (workouts, meals, profile) is sent to FITNEX\'s secure server and to Google Gemini to generate the answer. Nothing is sent unless you ask. You can change this in Settings.</string>
    <string name="onb_ai_off_note">Without this permission, FITNEX works the same except for the assistant and photo analysis.</string>
    <string name="onb_disclaimer">FITNEX offers general guidance on training and nutrition. It does not replace health professionals, dietitians or coaches who can assess you in person.</string>
